    "First debug rendered startup ended without a result. A repeat using the same exported code passed 587 checks but had non-isolated shader-cache diagnostics, so it is not selected. Initial cause is not conclusively localized. Ground exports now match the maintained 1800-frame allowance and record child process exits/result presence; fresh debug/release checks passed independently.",
    "The failed development project was reused for focused probes; its last debug source and compact outputs are retained without claiming exact snapshots of every earlier probe or counting them as acceptance.",
    "The earlier ramp/human and machine audits retain their historical checkpoint values. This audit supersedes current stair tuning/contact qualification only; full assembled routes and named real-provider/SAVE gates remain open.",
